Z||000004||Raydar||05-16-2001||03:15 PM||||I've heard of people using Camaro or Firebird seats in the Fiero. Might have to change the tracks on the right side, and slot the rear holes on the left side.<BR>I've also heard of people using the same seats in S-10s. That leads me to believe that S-10 seats might fit in a Fiero, too. <P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<P>88 black Formula<BR>88 Duke coupe <BR>88 "wadded up" Formula (parts car)||||reg||1
